    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Magic action, you can expend 1 Focus Point to touch a creature and restore Hit Points equal to a roll of your Martial Arts die plus your Wisdom modifier. When you use your Flurry of Blows, you can replace one of the Unarmed Strikes with a use of this feature without expending a Focus Point for the healing.</p>",
